= Claudio Treves

Treves is a prominent journalist within the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span>, having written for several newspapers from *Avanti!* to *Critica Sociale*, whilst aligning himself with the <span style=" color:#FF6961">reformists</span> within the party.

- @judicial_reform_treves
- @media_treves
- @labour_rights_treves
- @root: Return to main

@judicial_reform_treves
title: Judicial Reform
subtitle: Now that we are in control of the Justice Ministry, we are able to reform it to purge corruption and <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">reactionary</span> forces.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psi_in_government and justice_minister_party == psi_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psi_in_government : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> is not currently in government. ?][? if not justice_minister_party == psi_name : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> does not currently control the Justice Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; judiciary_reform_timer -= 5;
go-to: judiciary_reform

@media_treves
title: Media
subtitle: Organise our media to spread our message further.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; media_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: media

@labour_rights_treves
title: Labour Rights
subtitle: Now that we are in government, we can reform labour laws to help out our main support base, the workers.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psi_in_government and labour_minister_party == psi_name
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psi_in_government : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> is not in government to influence policy. ?][? if not labour_minister_party == psi_name : The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#ED2855">[+ psi_name +]</span> does not control the Labour and Social Security Ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: labour_rights
